	<p>Last updated: Oct 30, 2026</p>

	<h2>The short version</h2>
	<p>Clear Paths is made by Cloudgate Studios. We do not collect your personal information, and we cannot see your game data.</p>
	<p>Your worlds and settings are stored on your device. If you are signed in to iCloud, they also sync through your own private iCloud account, so they can appear on your other devices. Clear Paths has no accounts, ads, analytics, or tracking.</p>
	<p>This policy covers the Clear Paths app for iPhone and iPad.</p>

	<h2>What the app stores</h2>
	<p>The app stores only what it needs to run the game and remember your choices.</p>
